  "contentHtml": "<p>카톡방에 올라온 질문</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f69f86ed0fa47f6ad6a813a35efc11bb6d3a30e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f69f86ed0fa47f6ad6a813a35efc11bb6d3a30e\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"526\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>답변)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1번&#160;참고&#160;의견&#160;드릴게요. <br><br>수능&#160;및&#160;학평&#160;편집&#160;기준 <br>띄기도&#160;하고&#160;안띄기도&#160;하는데&#160;띄는&#160;경우 <br>&#39;Alt+스페이스바&#39;를&#160;이용해서&#160;&#39;고정폭빈칸&#39;을&#160;사용합니다. <br>그러면&#160;반각으로&#160;표현되어&#160;너무&#160;넓지&#160;않은&#160;빈&#160;칸으로&#160;표현할&#160;수&#160;있습니다.&#160; <br>전각 한 칸보다 보기가 좋습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70e924d035d3fc0b0a2b8872ccd73ecf32d2e247\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70e924d035d3fc0b0a2b8872ccd73ecf32d2e247\" data-origin-width=\"1148\" data-origin-height=\"515\"></div><p>왼쪽&#160;이미지)&#160;고정폭&#160;빈&#160;칸을&#160;사용한&#160;경우 <br><br>오른쪽&#160;이미지)&#160;고정폭&#160;빈&#160;칸&#160;사용을&#160;확인할&#160;때,&#160; <br>[메뉴]&#160;보기&gt;표시/숨기기&gt;조판&#160;부호&#160;체크박스&#160;표시&#160; <br><br>일반&#160;스페이스바&#160;띄어쓰기는&#160;v로&#160;표시되고 <br>고정폭&#160;빈&#160;칸은&#160;[고정폭&#160;빈&#160;칸]으로&#160;표시됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97e0831359f213bf7b6b646003ad7bf49fed8ae3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97e0831359f213bf7b6b646003ad7bf49fed8ae3\" data-origin-width=\"1359\" data-origin-height=\"892\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/960054bbf1381645e736f150d8ed847e4cd96a9f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/960054bbf1381645e736f150d8ed847e4cd96a9f\" data-origin-width=\"1359\" data-origin-height=\"892\"></div><p>위의&#160;이미지&#160;파일에서는&#160;&#39;10배&#39;를&#160;표현할&#160;때&#160;[고정폭&#160;빈&#160;칸]을&#160;사용한&#160;것을&#160;알&#160;수&#160;있습니다. <br>------------------------------------ <br>[Tip]&#160;고사원안&#160;작업할&#160;때&#160;학평파일&#160;참고하기 <br><br>교육청&#160;홈페이지에&#160;수능모의고사는&#160;pdf로&#160;올라옵니다. <br>학력평가는&#160;요즘에는&#160;pdf로&#160;올라오지만,&#160;과거에는&#160;hwp로&#160;올라왔습니다. <br>과거&#160;hwp&#160;파일을&#160;열어보면&#160;편집&#160;상태를&#160;참고할&#160;수&#160;있습니다. <br><br>조판&#160;부호&#160;보기를&#160;통해서 <br>[고정폭&#160;빈&#160;칸]은&#160;물론&#160;다양한&#160;편집&#160;기능&#160;사용&#160;상태(수식,&#160;머리말,&#160;새&#160;쪽&#160;번호,&#160;그림&#160;등)를&#160;알&#160;수&#160;있습니다. <br><br>문제를&#160;복사해&#160;왔는데&#160;쪽수까지&#160;딸려오는&#160;경우&#160;조판&#160;부호&#160;보기를&#160;통해&#160;지울&#160;수&#160;있습니다. <br><br>한글&#160;문서&#160;편집하실&#160;때&#160;참고하셔요^^</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/98ee2a2283454d02647c2bcfb705e92a0f07d60f?download\" data-file-name=\"1804고3생명과학Ⅱ_문항지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1507328\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DYNeK%26dataid%3D32%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20221028213108&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F98ee2a2283454d02647c2bcfb705e92a0f07d60f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">1804고3생명과학Ⅱ_문항지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.44MB</div></div></a></div><p>학평문제 첨부합니다. 열여서 조판 부호 보기로 확인해 보세요.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
